#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:1
#: a05e6382d44f4d5cafde168487e7b14d
msgid "Force control and compliance"
msgstr "力控与柔顺"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:3
#: 768c4ba2106d4fe285a0529c0c9be90a
msgid ""
"On a real arm, use one of the two paths below so the arm can give under "
"contact. **Payload identification (负载辨识)** belongs to the **vendor-"
"impedance** path (Tianji / Rokae)."
msgstr "真机上，手臂要在接触时能退让，用下面两条路径之一。**负载辨识**属于**厂商阻抗**路径（天玑 / 珞石）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md
#: a592f630b2084a8da0359adb5a9b7435
msgid "Path"
msgstr "路径"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md
#: a0dc657c538e4177a943d50aad90dbd7
msgid "Robots"
msgstr "机器人"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md
#: 3d9009bcd24247158fe991a1160e16e1
msgid "Who provides compliance"
msgstr "柔顺由谁提供"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md
#: 9054c7191d3048b5a054bde8498ef8b1
msgid "What the controller commands"
msgstr "控制器下发什么"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md
#: 6937be31b2b64506938534de40b09ea8
msgid "**MIT-mode force control**"
msgstr "**MIT 力控**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md
#: c29918b58898441d876db9c2c749957d
msgid "**HighTorque** (高擎) **Panthera HT**; **ARX** (方舟无限) arms"
msgstr "**高擎 Panthera HT**；**方舟无限** 机械臂"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md
#: 1772e47a952c4deb9fd903af84d26df8
msgid ""
"Controller + hardware interface in MIT / `full_control` (pos + vel + "
"effort; stiffness on the HI)"
msgstr "控制器 + 驱动层走 MIT / `full_control`（位置 + 速度 + 力矩；刚度在驱动层上）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md
#: 85ee8d484d3a42a6b90e5af2c81a7f64
msgid "Force-capable / MIX when the interfaces allow it"
msgstr "接口齐全时走带力控 / MIX"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md
#: f5bcb9ec5a034908b287169716a953ca
msgid "**Vendor joint impedance**"
msgstr "**厂商关节阻抗**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md
#: f2ec9b3703bf4e97a254103c3655ae71
msgid "**Tianji** (天玑); **Rokae** (珞石)"
msgstr "**天玑**；**珞石**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md
#: 108451fbd527479c8846222bae66c2b3
msgid "Vendor stack, exposed on the hardware interface"
msgstr "厂商栈，经驱动层暴露"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md
#: 1b482a46edbf4aa398480df3e80b4baf
msgid "**Position only**"
msgstr "**仅位置**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:10
#: 7a12b5f4462e425081e853d9e10a6ca3
msgid "MIT-mode force control (Panthera HT / ARX)"
msgstr "MIT 力控（Panthera HT / 方舟无限）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:12
#: 88d9a2f5864d44bbad30d5cc0594eeea
msgid ""
"Use this path on **Panthera HT** and **ARX** arms. The hardware interface"
" must run a **force-capable** MIT configuration; the controller then "
"tracks the pose target with that mix of position / velocity / effort. VR "
"teleop is one client of this path: [VR "
"Teleoperation](../5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"在 **Panthera HT** 和 **方舟无限** 机械臂上走这条路径。驱动层必须运行**带力控**的 MIT 配置；控制器再用位置 / "
"速度 / 力矩的组合跟踪位姿目标。VR 遥操作是这条路径的一种用法：[VR "
"遥操作](../5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:14
#: d052c08ad9c840c6b8ccced15939a16a
msgid ""
"**HighTorque Panthera HT** — [ht-ros2-control README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/ht-ros2-control/blob/main/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**高擎 Panthera HT** — [ht-ros2-control README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/ht-ros2-control/blob/main/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:16
#: d9de363d79994643b9af24f067134f12
msgid "HI `control_mode:=mit` (default; older name `full_control` still accepted)"
msgstr "驱动层 `control_mode:=mit`（默认；旧名 `full_control` 仍可用）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:17
#: e242eb41c366436784c01a6d7501c990
msgid ""
"The driver sends position + velocity + effort + kp/kd "
"(`pos_vel_tqe_kp_kd`)"
msgstr "驱动下发位置 + 速度 + 力矩 + kp/kd（`pos_vel_tqe_kp_kd`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:18
#: 9e7809fda02d4e2fa0a83827d87028d2
msgid ""
"Stiffness is HI parameters `joint_kp` / `joint_kd` (rqt / `ros2 param`), "
"**not** kp/kd command interfaces"
msgstr "刚度是驱动层参数 `joint_kp` / `joint_kd`（rqt / `ros2 param`），**不是** kp/kd 命令接口"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:19
#: a14b4aa307e24b02a7fe393d238b9b29
msgid ""
"Other documented HI modes: `effort` (torque only), `position` (position "
"only)"
msgstr "文档里驱动层的其他模式：`effort`（仅力矩）、`position`（仅位置）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:21
#: 42d5b5cecb8248e6ab2beb1ea99b0300
msgid ""
"**ARX arms** — [arx-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/arx-ros2-control/blob/main/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**方舟无限机械臂** — [arx-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/arx-ros2-control/blob/main/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:23
#: e719b181e4ac4f4fb0c7b5f223d3df0d
msgid ""
"Arms support only `full_control` / MIT MIX. Other `control_mode` values "
"in xacro are warned and ignored"
msgstr "机械臂只支持 `full_control` / MIT MIX。xacro 里写的其他 `control_mode` 会告警并被忽略"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:24
#: 05e377c2c65947fd96875ae854dfe874
msgid "`write()` always sends position + velocity + effort"
msgstr "`write()` 始终下发位置 + 速度 + 力矩"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:25
#: a6631017f0da454594b6c2982834e057
msgid ""
"MIT `kp` / `kd` come from HI `joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains` (no kp/kd "
"command interface)"
msgstr "MIT 的 `kp` / `kd` 来自驱动层的 `joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains`（没有 kp/kd 命令接口）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:26
#: 77fd53eb6357468c9bdfd201ee42eb7f
msgid ""
"README mapping: OCS2 trajectory → position; OCS2 `future_input` → "
"velocity; OCS2 effort → gravity / static feedforward torque"
msgstr "README 映射：OCS2 轨迹 → 位置；OCS2 `future_input` → 速度；OCS2 力矩 → 重力 / 静力学前馈力矩"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:28
#: e8d86728877344bf8c55e13f88973ade
msgid ""
"**Controller** — [ocs2_arm_controller README — Interface "
"Configuration](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**控制器** — [ocs2_arm_controller README — 接口配置](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:30
#: 48ae35c29f9f476e9009b2a84e6d24a5
msgid ""
"Mode is **auto-detected** from the robot config (no extra launch flag "
"named `force:=`)"
msgstr "模式由机器人配置**自动检测**（没有名为 `force:=` 的额外 launch 参数）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:31
#: e838d654402a4576a312caa8340e881e
msgid "Position-only: command `position`; state `position` + `velocity`"
msgstr "仅位置：命令 `position`；状态 `position` + `velocity`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:32
#: 34aff7c686db428092c61b3ead920710
msgid ""
"Force / MIX: command `position`, `velocity`, `effort`, `kp`, `kd` all "
"present. `[kp, kd]` is `default_gains` (HOME / HOLD) and `pd_gains` (OCS2"
" state), **Startup only**. The older name `force_gains` is not a "
"parameter"
msgstr ""
"力控 / MIX：命令接口里 `position`、`velocity`、`effort`、`kp`、`kd` 都有。`[kp, kd]` 由 "
"`default_gains`（HOME / HOLD）和 `pd_gains`（OCS2 状态）给出，**仅启动**。旧名 "
"`force_gains` 不是参数"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:33
#: 393e0c4392ff4ba0812529c4ba37d256
msgid ""
"ARX documents OCS2 MIX as pos + vel + effort with kp/kd on the HI. HT "
"notes that when kp/kd are **not** command interfaces, OCS2 may stay in "
"position mode; gravity compensation then uses `ht_gravity_compensation` "
"or larger `joint_kp` (same HT README)"
msgstr ""
"方舟无限文档把 OCS2 MIX 写成位置 + 速度 + 力矩，kp/kd 在驱动层上。高擎说明：当 kp/kd **不是**命令接口时，OCS2"
" 可能停在位置模式；重力补偿改用 `ht_gravity_compensation` 或调大 `joint_kp`（同一份 HT README）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:35
#: 2d594e3ed0194310bb08bc78db5c88ef
msgid ""
"Bring the robot up with the lean-branch `./quick_start.sh` / "
"`hardware:=real` path on [HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md) or [ARX Lift "
"2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md). For the headset,"
" follow [VR Teleoperation](../5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)."
msgstr "用精简分支的 `./quick_start.sh` / `hardware:=real` 把机器人拉起来，见 [高擎 Panthera HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md) 或 [方舟无限 Lift 2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md)。头显按 [VR 遥操作](../5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:37
#: ab416f3ffd8843d4930326e58f51962f
msgid ""
"Master–slave `mode:=mit` / `effort` on Panthera HT is [Isomorphic "
"Teleop](../5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"Panthera HT 上主从的 `mode:=mit` / `effort` 见 "
"[同构遥操作](../5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:39
#: c88a76983f434b6daa690f4588390c99
msgid "Vendor joint impedance (Tianji / Rokae)"
msgstr "厂商关节阻抗（天玑 / 珞石）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:41
#: 2c806044a9d64b918c3d4de1c4980579
msgid ""
"Use this path on **Tianji** (天玑) and **Rokae** (珞石). The controller only "
"sends **joint position**. Joint impedance / compliance is the **vendor** "
"feature, switched on the hardware interface."
msgstr "在 **天玑** 和 **珞石** 上走这条路径。控制器只发 **关节位置**。关节阻抗 / 柔顺是**厂商**能力，在驱动层上切换。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:43
#: 434db51fc65545a684809d36d1ee4b9b
msgid ""
"**Tianji** — [marvin-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**天玑** — [marvin-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:45
#: e2f7116a862f464a92bd8585e84e9d4b
msgid ""
"Command interfaces: joint **`position` only**. State: `position`, "
"`velocity`, `effort`"
msgstr "命令接口：关节 **仅 `position`**。状态：`position`、`velocity`、`effort`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:46
#: cbdee36998ce4a72be1cdec97dc3bdb8
msgid ""
"Runtime `ctrl_mode`: `POSITION` / `JOINT_IMPEDANCE` / `CART_IMPEDANCE` / "
"`POWER_OFF`"
msgstr ""
"运行时 `ctrl_mode`：`POSITION` / `JOINT_IMPEDANCE` / `CART_IMPEDANCE` / "
"`POWER_OFF`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:47
#: e665559dc66547979698b27187c102c1
msgid ""
"Joint impedance gains: `joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains` (7 values). "
"Cartesian: `cart_k_gains` / `cart_d_gains`"
msgstr ""
"关节阻抗增益：`joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains`（7 维）。笛卡尔：`cart_k_gains` / "
"`cart_d_gains`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:48
#: 0471f8de129a48788352b79182664899
msgid "Example: `ros2 param set /<hardware_node> ctrl_mode JOINT_IMPEDANCE`"
msgstr "示例：`ros2 param set /<hardware_node> ctrl_mode JOINT_IMPEDANCE`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:50
#: eb67863b994f43de995ed08d2922fdd6
msgid ""
"**Rokae** — same pattern (position commands; compliance in the vendor "
"HI). Parameter names are in the private `rokae-ros2-control` README after"
" access. Overview: [Hardware "
"Interfaces](../../4-reference/hardware/0-index.md)."
msgstr ""
"**珞石** — 同一模式（位置命令；柔顺在厂商驱动层）。参数名在开通后的私有 `rokae-ros2-control` "
"README。概览：[驱动层](../../4-reference/hardware/0-index.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:52
#: 0512a9ae17f64cba97a411307fcf1b7d
msgid ""
"Internal FA robots that use Tianji / Rokae arms live in [fa-deploy-ws "
"Setup](../../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md). Extra robot IDs and "
"launch flags are in that workspace README after access."
msgstr ""
"使用天玑 / 珞石臂的内部第五纪机器人见 [fa-deploy-ws "
"配置](../../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)。额外机器人 ID 和 launch "
"参数在开通后的该仓库 README。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:54
#: 64ca69772ff54d2a85d399d67dd7328b
msgid "Payload identification (负载辨识)"
msgstr "负载辨识"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:56
#: 894e14c809234767972509d34080de56
msgid ""
"负载辨识 is **only** on the Tianji / Rokae (vendor impedance) path. The MIT /"
" OCS2 side uses `default_gains` / `pd_gains` for `[kp, kd]`. It does not "
"run this wizard."
msgstr ""
"负载辨识**只**在天玑 / 珞石（厂商阻抗）路径上。MIT / OCS2 这边用 `default_gains` / `pd_gains` 写 "
"`[kp, kd]`，不跑这个向导。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:58
#: 7cc8e27aa0a44eb79a72178c31a5aec9
msgid ""
"**Public, verified Tianji wizard** (semi-automatic tool-dynamics ID on "
"CCS): [marvin-ros2-control "
"`scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py), "
"installed as `ros2 run marvin_ros2_control tool_dyn_identify_wizard` "
"(`CMakeLists.txt` `install(PROGRAMS … RENAME tool_dyn_identify_wizard)`)."
msgstr ""
"**公开、核对过的天玑向导**（CCS 上半自动工具动力学辨识）：[marvin-ros2-control "
"`scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/marvin-"
"ros2-control/blob/master/scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py)，安装后为 `ros2 "
"run marvin_ros2_control tool_dyn_identify_wizard`（`CMakeLists.txt` 的 "
"`install(PROGRAMS … RENAME tool_dyn_identify_wizard)`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:60
#: 86e9cf73f3ad481ea8f6dd65973ea5da
msgid ""
"The wizard banner is **机械臂负载辨识向导（工具动力学参数辨识 / CCS）**. It connects to the "
"Marvin controller IP, collects no-load then loaded PVT trajectories, and "
"prints 10-D tool dynamics (`m, mx, my, mz, ixx, …`). Those values match "
"HI parameters `left_dyn_param` / `right_dyn_param` on the same README."
msgstr ""
"向导标题是**机械臂负载辨识向导（工具动力学参数辨识 / CCS）**。它连接 Marvin 控制器 IP，先采空载再采带载 PVT 轨迹，并打印"
" 10 维工具动力学（`m, mx, my, mz, ixx, …`）。这些值对应同一 README 里的驱动层参数 "
"`left_dyn_param` / `right_dyn_param`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:62
#: 9a0a826d0dab4a3f851fbbe9dc10a481
msgid ""
"There is **no** public `open-deploy-ws` payload-ID flow. Internal on-site"
" Tianji payload identification is in the private **fa-deploy-ws** README "
"after access (default branch is typically `fa-w2`). Use that README’s "
"script names — they are not listed here."
msgstr ""
"公开的 `open-deploy-ws` **没有**负载辨识流程。内部现场天玑负载辨识在开通后的私有 **fa-deploy-ws** "
"README（默认分支通常是 `fa-w2`）。脚本名以该 README 为准，这里不列出。"

